{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_23_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_23","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_23_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_23","textTraditional":"十有二年春正月。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_23_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_23","textTraditional":"夏六月壬寅，公會杞侯、莒子盟于曲池。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_23_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_23","textTraditional":"秋七月丁亥，公會宋公、燕人盟于穀丘。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_23_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_23","textTraditional":"八月壬辰，陳侯躍卒。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_23_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_23","textTraditional":"公會宋公于虛。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_23_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_23","textTraditional":"冬十有一月，公會宋公于龜。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_23_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_23","textTraditional":"丙戌，公會鄭伯，盟于武父。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_23_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_23","textTraditional":"丙戌，衛侯晉卒。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_23_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_23","textTraditional":"十有二月，及鄭師伐宋。丁未，戰于宋。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_23_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_23","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_ttr_23_12","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_23","textTraditional":"十二年夏，盟于曲池，平杞、莒也。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_ttr_23_13","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_23","textTraditional":"公欲平宋、鄭。秋，公及宋公盟于句瀆之丘。宋成未可知也，故又會于虛。冬，又會于龜。宋公辭平，故與鄭伯盟于武父。遂帥師而伐宋，戰焉，宋無信也。君子曰：「苟信不繼，盟無益也。《詩》云：『君子屢盟，亂是用長。』無信也。」","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_ttr_23_14","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_23","textTraditional":"楚伐絞，軍其南門。莫敖屈瑕曰：「絞小而輕，輕則寡謀，請無扞采樵者以誘之。」從之。絞人獲三十人。明日，絞人爭出，驅楚役徒於山中。楚人坐其北門，而覆諸山下，大敗之，為城下之盟而還。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_ttr_23_15","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_23","textTraditional":"伐絞之役，楚師分涉於彭。羅人欲伐之，使伯嘉諜之，三巡數之。","sentenceOrder":15}],"overrides":{}}